# `e2e/` and the Playwright config stay in the build context on purpose: the
# Docker build runs `next build`, which type-checks the same tsconfig program
# that `bun run typecheck` checks in CI — and a `src/` test imports
# `e2e/global-setup`. Excluding them made the image build fail with TS2307
# while every CI check stayed green, so the two contexts must agree.
